WEBVTT

00:18.710 --> 00:20.260
Seiichi...

00:20.260 --> 00:21.470
Seiichi...

00:21.470 --> 00:22.900
Master...

00:22.900 --> 00:24.500
Onii-chan!

00:24.500 --> 00:26.250
You gotta be kidding me, Boss Man...

00:26.250 --> 00:28.270
You died on us?

00:28.760 --> 00:30.630
Seiichi-sensei...

00:30.630 --> 00:32.210
Sensei...

00:32.210 --> 00:35.030
Sensei, it can't be...

00:35.030 --> 00:37.780
I didn't expect him to be lost...

00:38.970 --> 00:40.510
Seiichi...

00:48.980 --> 00:55.400
<b>Seiichi Dies...</b>

00:49.250 --> 00:51.700
"Seiichi Dies..."

00:55.580 --> 00:56.840
One, two!

00:56.840 --> 00:58.900
Thank you very much!

00:59.930 --> 01:01.580
Wait, it's not over yet!

01:01.580 --> 01:02.950
I'm alive! I'm still kicking!

01:06.790 --> 01:10.710
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

01:06.790 --> 01:10.710
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

01:07.870 --> 01:10.710
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:07.870 --> 01:10.710
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:07.870 --> 01:10.710
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

02:33.170 --> 02:38.090
<b>Seiichi Dies</b>

02:50.180 --> 02:52.950
Sei-chan, I finally found you.

02:56.750 --> 03:00.200
Uh, and you are... who?

03:01.830 --> 03:04.730
We've been together since 
middle school! I'm Airin!

03:05.200 --> 03:07.450
Airin? The seasoning?

03:07.450 --> 03:08.130
That's mirin.

03:07.660 --> 03:12.120
<b>Mirin</b>

03:08.130 --> 03:09.010
The bicycle thing?

03:09.010 --> 03:09.910
That's racing (keirin).

03:09.910 --> 03:11.030
The Pythagoras thing?

03:11.030 --> 03:12.120
That's theorem (teiri).

03:13.050 --> 03:16.490
Um, shall I just explain it to you?

03:16.490 --> 03:18.260
Whose voice is that?

03:19.100 --> 03:20.430
It's been a long time.

03:20.430 --> 03:21.740
This is the underworld,

03:21.740 --> 03:24.090
the realm inhabited 
by the souls of the dead.

03:24.090 --> 03:26.220
Th-Th-The underworld?!

03:26.220 --> 03:27.990
You mean I died?!

03:28.910 --> 03:30.610
that's right, Seiichi!

03:30.610 --> 03:32.460
You are already dead.

03:32.460 --> 03:33.060
Huh?

03:33.060 --> 03:36.530
Oh, Seiichi! How pathetic of you to go and die!

03:36.530 --> 03:38.780
Uh, were you always like this?

03:38.780 --> 03:40.650
Airi is dead.

03:40.650 --> 03:41.340
That's a bad joke.

03:41.340 --> 03:42.180
Pardon me.

03:42.180 --> 03:45.070
It's been so long since I was 
around, I misread our closeness.

03:45.070 --> 03:46.900
Now, once more...

03:46.900 --> 03:51.050
If you, the protagonist, remain dead,
this series is finished.

03:51.050 --> 03:53.930
So please find some way 
to come back to life.

03:53.930 --> 03:56.000
Okay... but how do I do that?

03:56.510 --> 03:58.850
You must find the Gate of the Living

03:58.850 --> 04:02.240
that exists somewhere in the 
underworld, and pass through it.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.930
Gate of the Living?

04:04.340 --> 04:07.740
If we pass through that gate, 
we can go back to our original world?

04:07.740 --> 04:09.190
You catch on quickly.

04:09.190 --> 04:11.600
Now hurry up and get to it!

04:11.600 --> 04:15.940
I'll do my best to see you 
brought back to life, Sei-chan!

04:17.040 --> 04:20.540
So let's get going to the Gate of the Living!

04:20.540 --> 04:22.400
Yeah!

04:22.400 --> 04:23.870
Y-Yeah.

04:23.870 --> 04:25.150
Get more pumped up!

04:25.150 --> 04:26.490
Yeah!

04:26.490 --> 04:32.890
I call it the "Sudden Cross-the-Styx 
Yes-or-No Ultra Quiz"!

04:26.490 --> 04:41.610
<b>Sudden   Cross
Ultra Quiz</b>

04:32.890 --> 04:36.460
I will be asking you 
questions about your life.

04:36.460 --> 04:39.030
To pass the checkpoints, 
you must choose yes or no.

04:39.030 --> 04:42.040
Leap into whichever you think is the answer.

04:42.040 --> 04:45.210
Uh, and what happens if I get it wrong?

04:45.210 --> 04:47.180
Then you splash into the Styx.

04:47.180 --> 04:48.380
Instant death.

04:48.380 --> 04:50.680
We're already dead, though.

04:50.680 --> 04:53.450
Do you want to go to 
the Gate of the Living?!

04:53.450 --> 04:54.820
I do!

04:53.520 --> 04:54.520
Yeah!

04:54.820 --> 04:57.770
Do you really, truly want to go?!

04:57.770 --> 04:58.520
Yeah.

04:57.900 --> 04:58.520
Yeah!

04:58.520 --> 05:00.360
I totally want to go for real!

04:58.520 --> 05:00.360
Yeah!

05:00.880 --> 05:02.240
Question!

05:03.080 --> 05:05.940
The reason Airin fell in love 
with Seiichi was...

05:05.940 --> 05:06.680
Huh?!

05:06.680 --> 05:08.110
Love at first sight!

05:08.110 --> 05:09.410
Yes or no?!

05:09.410 --> 05:10.740
Now, go!

05:11.520 --> 05:13.820
Airin, you're in love with me?

05:13.820 --> 05:16.300
Airi-san cannot answer you.

05:17.670 --> 05:20.900
I've never had anyone fall in love 
with me at first sight before,

05:20.900 --> 05:23.390
but there is still a possibility...

05:23.390 --> 05:26.560
You're surprisingly full of yourself, huh?

05:28.440 --> 05:29.680
Whatever! Let's do this!

05:29.680 --> 05:32.720
Now, yes or no? Choose your answer!

05:33.430 --> 05:33.680
Mmn!!

05:33.930 --> 05:34.180
Mmn!!

05:34.600 --> 05:34.850
Mmn!!

05:35.100 --> 05:35.390
Mmn!!

05:35.640 --> 05:35.930
Mmn!!

05:36.270 --> 05:39.310
<b>Mmn! Mnh!</b>

05:40.160 --> 05:43.420
Was it love at first sight, or was it not?

05:43.420 --> 05:45.270
I have no idea!

05:45.270 --> 05:46.990
Which was it?

05:53.750 --> 05:56.120
Hey, is she sending me some kind of signal?

05:56.530 --> 05:58.160
The shape of her legs...

05:58.160 --> 05:59.830
An X? So the answer is no?

05:59.830 --> 06:01.730
Oh, no, I might be wrong.

06:01.730 --> 06:04.250
Maybe she just needs to 
pee and she's holding it.

06:11.070 --> 06:13.350
Fine! I'll bet it all on this one!

06:14.770 --> 06:17.240
Monkey Turn!

06:25.710 --> 06:27.220
Correct!

06:29.060 --> 06:30.750
Thank goodness!

06:32.740 --> 06:34.450
That was close...

06:35.040 --> 06:37.750
Sei-chan! Sei-chan!

06:39.920 --> 06:42.100
You got it right!

06:42.650 --> 06:44.880
You did it, Sei-chan!

06:45.310 --> 06:46.770
Airin...

06:46.770 --> 06:50.070
Now watch this video clip 
of the right answer!

06:56.700 --> 06:58.970
It was back in middle school.

06:58.970 --> 07:03.760
I always ate lunch alone 
because I didn't have any friends.

07:12.200 --> 07:16.050
That was when I first met you, Sei-chan.

07:16.050 --> 07:18.500
Use these if you'd like.

07:23.610 --> 07:25.900
Th-Thank you.

07:27.780 --> 07:30.100
Since neither of us fit in at school,

07:30.100 --> 07:33.200
we both started eating our 
lonely lunches together.

07:33.690 --> 07:37.490
Anyway, why are you here all alone?

07:37.490 --> 07:39.870
That's a rude thing to ask out of the blue.

07:39.870 --> 07:41.350
Oh, I'm sorry.

07:41.350 --> 07:43.210
I didn't mean anything by it.

07:43.600 --> 07:44.890
It's just...

07:44.890 --> 07:48.860
You're not being bullied like I am, right?

07:48.860 --> 07:50.280
So I wondered why...

07:51.470 --> 07:55.280
I'm just not good at talking to others.

07:56.140 --> 07:58.700
Even though you chat with me so much?

07:58.700 --> 08:02.620
Well, that's... because you're easy to talk to.

08:02.620 --> 08:06.350
Besides, I look so utterly plain,

08:06.350 --> 08:08.120
so I'm not very confident.

08:08.630 --> 08:12.300
You should have more confidence in yourself.

08:12.730 --> 08:13.730
Huh?

08:14.220 --> 08:15.620
You're, well...

08:15.620 --> 08:19.650
You're a nice, honest girl, 
and you're a good listener.

08:19.650 --> 08:21.890
Plus, I think you're cute.

08:21.890 --> 08:24.310
C-Cute?

08:24.700 --> 08:27.550
So I'm sure you could make friends

08:27.550 --> 08:31.110
if you approached others the same 
way you're talking to me right now.

08:32.990 --> 08:36.910
S-Sorry for saying such odd things.

08:39.690 --> 08:41.160
N-No...

08:41.760 --> 08:44.220
You called me cute.

08:47.610 --> 08:50.940
It wasn't love at first sight 
because she gradually became

08:50.940 --> 08:54.620
attracted to your kindness 
as you chatted on the roof.

08:55.760 --> 08:58.180
You're the girl I ate lonely lunches with!

08:59.210 --> 09:02.710
You finally remembered me, Sei-chan.

09:02.710 --> 09:06.270
I'm who am I now because of you.

09:07.220 --> 09:09.010
I didn't know.

09:09.010 --> 09:13.950
So I swore that this time I would 
risk my life to protect you!

09:16.930 --> 09:18.200
Airin...

09:21.120 --> 09:25.480
So congratulations on passing 
the first checkpoint!

09:25.480 --> 09:27.020
Yay!

09:27.020 --> 09:29.460
Now, we're finally at the last checkpoint!

09:29.460 --> 09:30.540
Huh?! The last one already?!

09:34.730 --> 09:37.720
I'm speaking to you today for one reason alone.

09:37.720 --> 09:41.410
We've received a letter 
from the Demon Kingdom

09:41.410 --> 09:44.600
officially requesting to forge an alliance.

09:46.980 --> 09:49.310
Long time no bridge!

09:49.780 --> 09:52.610
So it's finally time for us to shine!

09:52.610 --> 09:54.650
You haven't changed at all, Guscle.

09:54.650 --> 09:56.610
Wait, where's Eris?

09:56.610 --> 09:58.080
Right here.

10:00.190 --> 10:02.530
What?!

10:02.530 --> 10:05.460
I'm guessing I was in the bath too long and

10:05.460 --> 10:08.290
the heat put me to sleep,
so you tied me up while I was out?!

10:08.290 --> 10:12.220
It's a wooden horse. It looks more painful 
than it is... but it does hurt a little.

10:12.220 --> 10:14.760
It has a sauna mat laid over it, too.

10:14.760 --> 10:18.960
It's important for ropes and 
alliances to be bound tightly!

10:18.960 --> 10:21.240
Listen when people talk!

10:22.890 --> 10:24.680
Everyone, listen.

10:24.680 --> 10:26.520
We're forging the alliance

10:26.520 --> 10:29.470
with the Wimberg Kingdom that 
we've been working on for a while.

10:29.880 --> 10:35.900
Now we demons can truly reclaim 
our smiles and move forward.

10:37.360 --> 10:39.990
There's only one more step 
to ratify the alliance.

10:40.470 --> 10:42.820
Everyone, please lend me your aid.

10:43.730 --> 10:47.000
We're with you, Demon Lord.

10:47.560 --> 10:51.670
If anyone has any thoughts, 
feel free to voice them now.

10:52.420 --> 10:54.590
I have one concern.

10:54.590 --> 10:56.000
What is it?

10:56.390 --> 11:00.930
There are several people in the Wimberg 
Kingdom who are beyond comprehension.

11:00.930 --> 11:04.850
Especially that unfathomable 
Guild Master, Guscle.

11:05.210 --> 11:08.270
I don't think it would be wise 
to allow him to get close to you.

11:10.520 --> 11:12.010
That's certainly true.

11:12.010 --> 11:14.400
A naked muscle-man? 
Humans are so strange.

11:14.400 --> 11:19.080
I think I'm likely to get along 
well with them all.

11:20.090 --> 11:22.470
Lutia-sama, please rest assured.

11:22.470 --> 11:26.490
There is one individual, Eris,
who is relatively normal.

11:26.870 --> 11:29.040
Relatively normal?

11:29.810 --> 11:31.210
Her.

11:36.050 --> 11:37.740
<i>She's kind of cute.</i>

11:38.890 --> 11:43.150
At any rate, the fate of this 
kingdom rests in your hands.

11:43.150 --> 11:45.180
I'm counting on you to handle it.

11:45.180 --> 11:48.530
Yeah! Time to shine once more!

11:48.530 --> 11:53.230
My arm's itching to go! 
No, my upper bicep is!

11:53.830 --> 11:55.840
My whip's ready to crack!

11:56.570 --> 12:00.460
Oh! It's finally time!

11:58.090 --> 11:59.920
<i>I can always count on them...</i>

12:00.460 --> 12:01.950
<i>even though they're perverts!</i>

12:06.750 --> 12:10.310
Now for a short SM—sorry, commercial break.

12:14.100 --> 12:19.530
Seiichi and Airi have safely passed 
through the first checkpoint.

12:19.530 --> 12:22.390
Now they're desperately wandering 
in search of the next checkpoint.

12:22.390 --> 12:24.390
Hey, please quit making up 
stories of your own!

12:24.390 --> 12:26.090
We're not really wandering.

12:27.820 --> 12:31.050
And after wandering around, 
they finally arrived to find...

12:31.050 --> 12:32.060
It kept going!

12:32.060 --> 12:35.380
...that another trial was awaiting them!

12:35.380 --> 12:38.020
And after this, they would be in dire straits!

12:40.590 --> 12:42.940
I've been waiting for you, Seiichi!

12:44.030 --> 12:46.360
A-Aren't you...

12:46.790 --> 12:50.080
I am the great ancestor of the Rose Clan—

12:50.080 --> 12:52.000
The novel author, Miku-sensei?

12:52.000 --> 12:54.380
People call him the conqueror 
of the underworld!

12:54.380 --> 12:56.710
Shall We Do It the First!

12:56.710 --> 12:58.920
<b>Shall we do it?</b>

12:56.710 --> 12:58.930
Shall we do it?

12:58.930 --> 13:01.460
The ancestor of that guy 
who appeared in season 1?!

13:01.460 --> 13:03.960
Sei-chan, you know this mohawk guy?

13:03.960 --> 13:04.780
No!

13:04.780 --> 13:08.760
We don't know each other 
directly, but I love that ass!

13:09.230 --> 13:10.370
Come on!

13:11.580 --> 13:14.260
<i>This checkpoint is truly hell.</i>

13:14.260 --> 13:15.850
<i>In more ways than one.</i>

13:15.850 --> 13:19.810
Once you get through this labyrinth, 
you'll find the Gate of the Living.

13:19.810 --> 13:22.890
But don't expect to get through it that easily!

13:22.890 --> 13:25.780
We'll defend the Gate 
of the Living to the last!

13:25.780 --> 13:27.610
And, Seiichi,

13:27.610 --> 13:30.950
you'll need to protect your gate, too!

13:30.950 --> 13:32.870
My gate?

13:32.870 --> 13:37.040
Not the Gate of the Living, 
but your personal gate!

13:37.040 --> 13:40.790
Gate

13:37.040 --> 13:40.790
Thing

13:37.040 --> 13:40.790
Opening

13:37.870 --> 13:40.020
His personal gate?

13:40.790 --> 13:44.350
I can't say it outright due 
to broadcast compliance,

13:44.350 --> 13:46.130
but I mean his ****!

13:46.130 --> 13:49.050
M-M-My ****?!

13:49.050 --> 13:50.260
Yes!

13:50.260 --> 13:55.070
If you let us **** your **** even once 
in the labyrinth, you're dead.

13:58.900 --> 14:04.320
<b>Crack</b>

13:59.760 --> 14:04.320
<i>No way! That's outrageous!</i>

14:04.320 --> 14:06.310
Muster your courage and break through!

14:06.310 --> 14:09.060
Through this final checkpoint, 
the mansion of hell!

14:09.060 --> 14:12.030
I'll protect Sei-chan, no matter what!

14:18.340 --> 14:21.330
Wait! Hey!

14:21.330 --> 14:22.180
Run!

14:22.180 --> 14:23.880
You can't escape!

14:23.880 --> 14:25.270
Wait!

14:25.270 --> 14:26.440
Huh? I'm alone?

14:26.440 --> 14:27.260
Yeah!

14:27.260 --> 14:29.180
Move it!

14:32.390 --> 14:34.600
And you're such a pretty girl, too!

14:34.600 --> 14:36.650
Splendid!

14:37.300 --> 14:38.440
You're open!

14:41.730 --> 14:43.860
Man, this is seriously gross, but...

14:43.860 --> 14:45.080
Take this!

14:48.030 --> 14:49.110
Sei-chan!

14:49.790 --> 14:53.540
It won't work! It won't work! It won't work!

14:53.540 --> 14:56.330
What the hell is going on 
with his ass muscles?!

14:56.330 --> 14:58.730
It's like they're actual buns of steel!

14:58.730 --> 15:01.560
You won't be able to **** 
with those fingers anymore!

15:01.560 --> 15:04.850
Now, surrender and live 
in the underworld, Seiichi!

15:04.850 --> 15:07.470
Join us in the Rose Clan!

15:07.470 --> 15:09.880
It's a fun second life!

15:10.230 --> 15:13.420
Anyone who renounces 
themselves is no longer human.

15:13.420 --> 15:15.060
Who are you supposed to be?

15:16.650 --> 15:18.390
Then die!

15:25.730 --> 15:28.650
M-Miku-sensei!

15:31.570 --> 15:33.440
Y-You guys!

15:35.690 --> 15:39.910
I will get revenge for you!

15:39.910 --> 15:41.750
Come on! Now's our chance!

15:43.980 --> 15:47.670
Wait!

15:49.310 --> 15:50.600
Airin!

15:50.600 --> 15:53.910
Sei-chan, don't worry about me. Just go!

15:55.850 --> 15:57.170
Seiichi!

15:57.170 --> 16:01.890
As the guardian of the Gate of the 
Living, I will not let you pass!

16:02.950 --> 16:06.720
I'll make this reverberate deep 
within your loins and beyond!

16:06.720 --> 16:10.880
This is the secret technique 
passed down in our Rose Clan!

16:10.880 --> 16:13.340
Our most powerful, ultimate skill...

16:13.340 --> 16:15.320
Rose Fist!

16:15.320 --> 16:17.490
Ah, I've seen this before.

16:17.490 --> 16:21.160
Also known as Rose ****!

16:26.880 --> 16:29.010
<i>He really loves his ****.</i>

16:29.720 --> 16:30.800
Sei-chan...

16:30.800 --> 16:32.760
Here I come, Seiichi!

16:33.460 --> 16:36.340
I'll **** your **** with my ****!

16:43.020 --> 16:48.040
I'll leave what's happening here 
up to your imagination!

16:51.690 --> 16:54.400
So, what is it, Jutis?

16:54.400 --> 16:56.610
Gempel-sama has taken action.

16:56.610 --> 16:58.030
Oh?

16:58.030 --> 17:00.030
Vitor-san has also...

17:00.540 --> 17:02.000
Hmm...

17:05.810 --> 17:08.680
Sounds like everyone's having fun.

17:10.490 --> 17:14.590
Sei-chan! Sei-chan!

17:14.590 --> 17:16.000
Seiichi...

17:16.000 --> 17:19.510
You've done well to survive this long 
with that soft personality of yours.

17:20.050 --> 17:23.380
However, you would have 
arrived at this fate eventually!

17:26.470 --> 17:28.160
Do It the First...

17:29.710 --> 17:31.220
The time has come.

17:32.530 --> 17:35.900
This is the moment I surpass you!

17:38.100 --> 17:39.680
N-No way!

17:39.680 --> 17:40.770
I'm...

17:40.770 --> 17:43.540
I, Do It the First, am trembling?!

17:44.500 --> 17:46.670
Do It the First...

17:46.670 --> 17:49.170
Hell is too tame for you.

17:49.170 --> 17:50.610
Sei-chan!

17:50.610 --> 17:52.960
Sei-chan, you're my god!

17:53.440 --> 17:56.500
Then I'll just have to fight a god!

18:07.640 --> 18:11.040
N-Never back down! Never grovel! 
Never repent!

18:11.040 --> 18:13.400
There is no escape for a king!

18:28.160 --> 18:29.800
It would seem...

18:29.800 --> 18:32.960
in the middle of battle, I forgot to fight.

18:43.110 --> 18:48.750
My life was one lived 
without a single regret!

18:54.080 --> 18:57.980
I need no name on my tombstone. If I die—

18:57.980 --> 18:59.550
Huh? Wait, hold on, what?

18:59.550 --> 19:01.780
Y-You're just leaving me? Hey...

19:02.110 --> 19:04.170
That was a struggle, Seiichi.

19:04.170 --> 19:06.130
You're safe now, after making it this far.

19:06.130 --> 19:09.830
I'll guide you to the Gate of the Living.

19:09.830 --> 19:13.670
I wish you'd done that from the start 
instead of pulling this stupid nonsense.

19:13.670 --> 19:18.140
People need trials, Seiichi.

19:18.140 --> 19:19.970
If it's a trial I need to go through,

19:19.970 --> 19:21.720
then I'll go through it, but...

19:21.720 --> 19:23.360
Seiichi,

19:23.360 --> 19:27.130
it was fun interacting with you 
again here in the underworld.

19:27.130 --> 19:30.830
Oh, have you noticed anything 
different about your Status lately?

19:30.830 --> 19:31.590
Huh?

19:33.400 --> 19:34.990
Seiichi?!

19:34.990 --> 19:36.330
Seiichi!

19:40.810 --> 19:42.310
Onii-chan!

19:42.310 --> 19:44.000
Seiichi!

19:44.000 --> 19:45.890
Seiichi!

19:46.530 --> 19:48.030
Sensei!

19:48.600 --> 19:51.940
Thank goodness. Truly, what a relief.

19:56.240 --> 19:57.460
Everyone...

19:59.730 --> 20:01.550
What's going on?

20:01.550 --> 20:03.890
Master!

20:04.370 --> 20:05.560
Louise?!

20:10.100 --> 20:11.140
Louise!

20:11.140 --> 20:11.910
Louise!

20:11.910 --> 20:13.370
Louise-san!

20:19.440 --> 20:21.510
Louise, hang in there!

20:21.510 --> 20:22.610
Louise-san!

22:02.190 --> 22:03.950
What's this emergency gathering for?

22:03.950 --> 22:05.530
Has there been some emergency?

22:05.530 --> 22:06.500
Yes.

22:06.500 --> 22:09.910
It's almost time to 
decide on today's dinner.

22:09.910 --> 22:11.580
Huh?! Dinner?!

22:11.580 --> 22:12.760
Sorry for the wait.

22:12.760 --> 22:15.700
Now, I shall take the lead in 
conducting our Great Devil Order—

22:15.700 --> 22:17.560
our What to Have for Dinner Meeting.

22:17.560 --> 22:19.110
You figure that out!

22:19.110 --> 22:20.780
How about yakisoba?

22:20.780 --> 22:22.100
What?! Not a chance!

22:22.100 --> 22:23.550
Then what about fried rice?

22:23.550 --> 22:24.500
Rejected!

22:24.500 --> 22:26.980
A classic example of a tiresome man.

22:26.980 --> 22:28.110
Shut up!

22:28.110 --> 22:31.910
I always eat yakisoba and 
fried rice for Saturday's lunch!

22:31.910 --> 22:33.420
You're very particular.

22:33.420 --> 22:35.540
Do you have any requests, Vitor-san?

22:35.540 --> 22:38.860
Then why don't we knead 
Hamburg steaks together?

22:38.860 --> 22:40.660
Have everyone make them by hand?

22:40.660 --> 22:42.180
We'll take that as one suggestion.

22:42.180 --> 22:43.150
Destra-sama?

22:43.150 --> 22:43.930
What?

22:43.930 --> 22:45.520
What are you drinking?

22:45.520 --> 22:46.740
I don't know.

22:46.740 --> 22:49.820
The angle at which you tilt your wine glass

22:49.820 --> 22:52.330
will change the amount 
that flows onto the tongue,

22:52.330 --> 22:56.250
so in order to better savor it, you should 
be more particular about your glasses.

22:54.930 --> 22:56.250
Can the useless trivia!

22:56.250 --> 22:57.820
Forgive me, but it takes great effort

22:57.820 --> 23:00.490
to dumb down conversation 
for an uneducated man like you.

23:00.490 --> 23:02.010
What'd you say, you bastard?!

23:02.010 --> 23:03.780
I merely stated the truth.

23:03.780 --> 23:06.160
Everyone, please listen.

23:06.160 --> 23:07.820
We still haven't decided on anything.

23:07.820 --> 23:09.110
Me, me!

23:09.110 --> 23:13.740
I want to eat truffles, foie gras, 
caviar, and cheese dakgalbi!

23:13.740 --> 23:16.010
That's quite the variety.

23:16.010 --> 23:18.610
Think you can buy it all by dinner?

23:18.610 --> 23:21.710
No, it would take quite 
some time if we started now.

23:21.710 --> 23:24.310
I want it! I want it! I want it!

23:24.310 --> 23:25.610
Buy it for me!

23:25.610 --> 23:27.710
Argh! At this point, I actually 
do want to eat yakisoba!

23:27.710 --> 23:29.970
Juicy, juicy, juicy meat!

23:32.010 --> 23:35.010
<b>To Be Continued</b>

23:35.710 --> 23:38.950
When I come back to life, I find Louise, 
leader of the Valkyries, before me.

23:38.950 --> 23:41.120
Wait, what happened to 
give her all these injuries?!

23:41.120 --> 23:43.810
Wimberg is moving to seal its 
alliance with the Demon Kingdom,

23:43.810 --> 23:45.270
so they're hosting a Guild Audition?!

23:43.810 --> 23:47.820
<b>Next Time 
The Four Leaders Closing In</b>

23:45.270 --> 23:46.860
Next time, "The Four Leaders Closing In"!

23:46.860 --> 23:48.960
They're finally making their move!
